// Stage D-P22 fixture matrices: the voice lane. Pinned arms over the
// frozen D-P15 live-session legs re-inlined from the frozen D-P21
// fixture's recorded arm — the voice request's parent is the D-P15
// establishment + read gate (NOT the D-P16 conversation lane and NOT the
// D-P21 reply lane), so the 13 gate legs here are the SAME structural
// copies the frozen D-P20 recorded arm carries. Every assessment below
// was produced by running the REAL D-P22 assessors over the pinned arm
// and serializing the result verbatim — the selftest re-runs the
// assessors and deep-equals the pin. Zero value imports (type-only,
// hygiene-enforced); deepFreeze over everything.
//
// Clock chain: establishment 60000 < retracted voice request 68000 <
// voice request 89000 < transcription decision 89500 <= evaluation 90000.
// The D-P21 lane is NOT a parent: the retracted-arm request event 68000
// predates the whole frozen D-P21 chain (88000+) yet its confinement is
// proven by retraction, not by event ordering.

